|º    The home screen                                                           º|
|º                                                                              º|
|º    It shows who is logged in, the access level, today's date, and how        º|
|º    many items, locations and categories the inventory holds.  A date         º|
|º    before 1990 means the PC's clock was never set: set it with the DOS       º|
|º    command DATE, ?????????????????????????? service records take today's     º|
|º    date.  With no items yet, Items > New item adds the firs??????????????????º|
|º    New location adds the rooms, shelves and boxes to keep them in.           º|
|º                                                                              º|
|º      F10          open the menu bar                                          º|
|º      Alt-letter   open the menu of that letter                               º|
|º      Ctrl-F       search the items                                           º|
|º      F3           quit (asks first)                                          º|
